abla_{X_{j}}X_{i} $$
그리고
$$  egin{align*} \dfrac{D }{\partial t}\dfrac{D }{\partial s}X_{i} &amp;= \dfrac{D }{\partial t}\left( \dfrac{\partial x_{j}}{\partial s}
abla_{X_{j}}X_{i} ight) \ &amp;= \dfrac{\partial^{2} x_{j}}{\partial t\partial s}
abla_{X_{j}}X_{i} + \dfrac{\partial x_{j}}{\partial s}
