따라서 다음을 얻는다.
$$ \dfrac{D }{\partial t}\dfrac{D }{\partial s}X_{i} - \dfrac{D }{\partial s}\dfrac{D }{\partial t}X_{i} = \dfrac{\partial x_{j}}{\partial s}\dfrac{\partial x_{k}}{\partial t}\left( 
